  "extraction": "Retain U29 default outbound serializer constants, limits, Serialize methods and graph traversal unchanged. U32 removes the unnecessary U31 internal DeserializeObject facade; native JSON input hands its prepared graph directly to original JsonValueProviderFactory. No public general serializer API, object conversion, converter or resolver support.",
  "native_adaptations": [
    "Class internal sealed; constructor initializes the original defaults directly.",
    "SecurityUtils CAS reflection wrappers replaced by native FieldInfo.GetValue and MethodInfo.Invoke for original public-instance members. No CAS/partial-trust emulation.",
    "HttpUtility.JavaScriptStringEncode resolves to native runtime; custom Framework HttpEncoder/configuration unavailable.",
    "Only used English AtlasWeb resource values retained; satellite localization not restored.",
    "U32 deletes the inbound serializer method; source/API JSON factory keeps a native-only prepared graph handoff or single native parse for custom contexts. Outbound extraction unchanged."
  ],
